        "action": "Provide more funding for tree planting, wildlife protection and green spaces",
        "additional_details": "I ask the government to take stronger action to tackle climate change by protecting nature. Young people should have a voice in decisions that affect our future.",
        "background": "I urge the UK Government to provide greater support and funding for local environmental improvements, including tree planting, protecting wildlife, restoring green spaces, while giving young people a meaningful role in environmental decision-making.",
